{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12998","headline":"与韩侍御同寻李七舍人不遇题壁留赠 · 独孤及","name":"与韩侍御同寻李七舍人不遇题壁留赠","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"三径何寂寂，主人山上山。\n亭空檐月在，水落钓矶闲。\n药院鸡犬静，酒垆苔藓班。\n知君少机事，当待暮云还。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"独孤及","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12998.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12998","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}